  "blocks": [
    {
      "text": "Workflow Automation allows you to create various Microsoft Teams notification templates using the notification template builder to send notifications to the Data Loss Prevention (DLP) admins, managers, approvers, and end users. The notification template builder ensures that the notification template displays properly to all Microsoft Teams clients."
    },
    {
      "text": "You can only add Microsoft Teams notification templates if you have integrated Workflow Automation with Microsoft Teams."
    },
    {
      "text": "To add a Microsoft Teams notification template:"
    },
    {
      "item": "On the Notification Template page:",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          28
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Template Name: Enter a name for the template.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          13
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Template Family: From the drop-down menu, select an existing template family or add a new template family.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          15
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "You cannot edit the template family for a template after the template is added.",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Type: From the drop-down menu, select Teams.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          4
        ],
        [
          38,
          43
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Digest: Enable this option if you want to make this template a digest notification template. This option identifies whether the template is for a digest type of notification (user digest and DLP admin digest) or a non-digest type of notification (user notification and escalation). After you select this option, the Digest Type field appears.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          6
        ],
        [
          316,
          327
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Source Language: From the drop-down menu, select a language in which you want to create the notification template.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          15
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Time Zone: (Optional) From the drop-down menu, select the time zone in which you want the time-related merge tags to appear in the notifications using this template. The Time merge tag represents the time when the incident occurred. When configuring the Microsoft Teams notification template, you have the option to use the time-related merge tags.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          9
        ],
        [
          170,
          174
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Digest Type: (Optional) From the drop-down menu, select the type of digest notification template you want to add. Digest types are End User and Admin. The selection you make in this field determines the merge tags that are available when configuring the template.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          11
        ],
        [
          131,
          139
        ],
        [
          144,
          149
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "After you select the template type, a section to create the Microsoft Teams notification template appears under the row on the page. Using the options at the top of this new section, you can create and design a Microsoft Teams notification template, change the content of the template, and insert links.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "In the content section, design the Microsoft Teams notification template by entering text and using one or more of the following options:",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "Font options: Change the font for the text to bold or italics.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          12
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Strikethrough: Apply the strikethrough format to the text.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          13
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "HTML: Add custom HTML.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          4
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Lists: Add a numbered list or a bulleted list.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          5
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Link: Apply a link to the text that you have entered.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          4
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Select Merge Tag: From the drop-down menu, select a merge tag. You can use the merge tags that are provided by Workflow Automation to include incident attribute values in the notifications. Merge tags are:",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          16
        ]
      ]
